concept:financial-sector-collection-of-data-act-2001-sec-5-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5(4) Entities covered by the Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-5-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) A regulated entity is any of the following:   Preliminary  Part 1  Section 5A Financial Sector (Collection of Data) Act 2001 Compilation date: 21/02/2025 (a) a body regulated by APRA (within the meaning of subsection 3(2) of the Australian Prudential Regulation Authority Act 1998); (c) a subsidiary of an ADI, or a subsidiary of an authorised NOHC, within the meaning of the Banking Act 1959." ;
