concept:financial-sector-collection-of-data-act-2001-sec-13c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "13C Minister may direct APRA to determine reporting standards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-13c ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, in writing, direct APRA to determine reporting standards under subsection 13(1B) that are to be complied with by any of the following: (a) financial sector entities of a kind referred to in paragraph 5(2)(e), or a class of those entities; (b) financial sector entities of a kind referred to in paragraph 5(2)(f), or a class of those entities; (c) a particular financial sector entity of a kind referred to in paragraph 5(2)(e) or (f), or particular financial sector entities of that kind. (2) A direction under subsection (1) is not a legislative instrument. (3) This section does not limit the power of APRA to determine reporting standards under subsection 13(1)." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may, in writing, direct APRA to determine reporting standards under subsection 13(1B) that are to be complied with by any of the following: (a) financial sector entities of a kind referred to in paragraph 5(2)(e), or a class of those entities; (b) financial sector entities of a kind referred to in paragraph 5(2)(f), or a class of those entities; (c) a particular financial sector entity of a kind referred to in paragraph 5(2)(e) or (f), or particular financial sector entities of that kind. (2) A direction under subsection (1) is not a legislative instrument. (3) This section does not limit the power of APRA to determine reporting standards under subsection 13(1)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "244fba18b419c04b4cf8ef08173b3d2c9e466e3f5f6d8dbce156ce12fd3c83ff" ;
    cof:pageNumber "30"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:financial-sector-collection-of-data-act-2001-sec-13c-ss-1 ;
