concept:financial-sector-collection-of-data-act-2001-sec-14-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "14(3) Principal executive officer of financial sector entity (other than a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-14-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The principal executive officer of a financial sector entity must not refuse or fail to notify the governing body of the entity as required by subsection (2). Penalty: 50 penalty units.   Provision of documents to APRA  Part 3 Determination of reporting standards and requirement to provide documents  Division 2 Section 15 Financial Sector (Collection of Data) Act 2001 Compilation date: 21/02/2025" ;
