    skos:prefLabel "14(1) Principal executive officer of financial sector entity (other than a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-14-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The reporting standards apply to a financial sector entity only on and after the day declared by APRA to be the day on which the standards begin to apply to the entity or to the class or kind of financial sector entities in which the entity is included." ;
