concept:financial-sector-collection-of-data-act-2001-sec-17-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "17(5) APRA may require the variation of a reporting document or the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-17-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Directions under subsection (3) or (4) must specify a period within which they are to be complied with. The period specified must not be less than 14 days beginning on the day on which the directions are given.   Provision of documents to APRA  Part 3 Determination of reporting standards and requirement to provide documents  Division 2 Section 17 Financial Sector (Collection of Data) Act 2001 Compilation date: 21/02/2025" ;
