doc:sec-17b-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "17B(1) Auditor’s functions and duties" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) If the auditor is aware of circumstances that amount to: (a) an attempt by any person to unduly influence, coerce, manipulate or mislead the auditor in connection with the performance of the auditor’s functions or duties; or (b) an attempt by any person to otherwise interfere with the performance of the auditor’s functions or duties;   Provision of documents to APRA  Part 3 Auditing of documents  Division 2A Section 17D Financial Sector (Collection of Data) Act 2001 Compilation date: 21/02/2025 the auditor must notify APRA in writing of those circumstances as soon as practicable, and in any case within 28 days, after the auditor becomes aware of those circumstances." ;
    cof:pageNumber "34"^^xsd:integer .

concept:financial-sector-collection-of-data-act-2001-sec-17b-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "17B(2) Auditor’s functions and duties"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-17b-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The auditor commits an offence if the auditor contravenes subsection (1). Penalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 50 penalty units, or both." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The auditor commits an offence if the auditor contravenes subsection (1). Penalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 50 penalty units, or both."@en ;
