doc:sec-21-2-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "21(2) Withdrawal of infringement notice" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) APRA may withdraw an infringement notice served on a person (whether or not the person has made representations seeking the   Provision of documents to APRA  Part 3 Administrative penalties in lieu of prosecution for certain offences  Division 3 Section 22 Financial Sector (Collection of Data) Act 2001 Compilation date: 21/02/2025 withdrawal) by causing written notice of the withdrawal to be served on the person within the period within which the penalty specified in the infringement notice is required to be paid." ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer .

concept:financial-sector-collection-of-data-act-2001-sec-21-2-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21(3) Withdrawal of infringement notice"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-21-2-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The matters to which APRA may have regard in deciding whether or not to withdraw an infringement notice include, but are not limited to, the following: (a) whether the person has previously been convicted of an offence for a contravention of this Act; (b) the circumstances in which the offence or offences specified in the notice are alleged to have been committed; (c) whether the person has been previously been served with an infringement notice in respect of which the person paid the penalty specified in the notice; (d) any written representations made by the person." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The matters to which APRA may have regard in deciding whether or not to withdraw an infringement notice include, but are not limited to, the following: (a) whether the person has previously been convicted of an offence for a contravention of this Act; (b) the circumstances in which the offence or offences specified in the notice are alleged to have been committed; (c) whether the person has been previously been served with an infringement notice in respect of which the person paid the penalty specified in the notice; (d) any written representations made by the person."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cb9a6178a424a8aa1129945ca22883b2194b2048e9ab7849e3b9375686e2857b" ;
    values:partOf concept:financial-sector-collection-of-data-act-2001-sec-21-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer ;
