doc:sec-21-2-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "21(3) Withdrawal of infringement notice" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The matters to which APRA may have regard in deciding whether or not to withdraw an infringement notice include, but are not limited to, the following: (a) whether the person has previously been convicted of an offence for a contravention of this Act; (b) the circumstances in which the offence or offences specified in the notice are alleged to have been committed; (c) whether the person has been previously been served with an infringement notice in respect of which the person paid the penalty specified in the notice; (d) any written representations made by the person." ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer .

concept:financial-sector-collection-of-data-act-2001-sec-21-2-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21(4) Withdrawal of infringement notice"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-21-2-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If: (a) the person pays the penalty specified in the infringement notice within the period within which the penalty is required to be paid; and (b) the notice is withdrawn after the person pays the penalty; APRA must refund to the person, out of money appropriated by the Parliament, an amount equal to the amount paid." ;
    skos:definition "(4) If: (a) the person pays the penalty specified in the infringement notice within the period within which the penalty is required to be paid; and (b) the notice is withdrawn after the person pays the penalty; APRA must refund to the person, out of money appropriated by the Parliament, an amount equal to the amount paid."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ca90b0e2ebeeb74e0d6be8ba2dc7dd3083b305470c38172b3b2596c552654757" ;
    values:partOf concept:financial-sector-collection-of-data-act-2001-sec-21-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Refund of penalty paid within specified period" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <financial-sector-collection-of-data-act-2001.pdf> ;
