doc:sec-21-2-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "21(4) Withdrawal of infringement notice" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) If: (a) the person pays the penalty specified in the infringement notice within the period within which the penalty is required to be paid; and (b) the notice is withdrawn after the person pays the penalty; APRA must refund to the person, out of money appropriated by the Parliament, an amount equal to the amount paid." ;
