    values:originalText "(1) A person in relation to whom a reviewable decision is made, may, if dissatisfied with the decision, request APRA to reconsider the decision." ;
    cof:pageNumber "42"^^xsd:integer .

concept:financial-sector-collection-of-data-act-2001-sec-25b-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "25B(2) Request for review of decisions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-25b-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The request must: (a) be made by notice in writing; and (b) be given to APRA within: (i) the period of 21 days after the day on which the decision first comes to the notice of the person; or (ii) within such further period as APRA allows; and (c) set out the reasons for making the request." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The request must: (a) be made by notice in writing; and (b) be given to APRA within: (i) the period of 21 days after the day on which the decision first comes to the notice of the person; or (ii) within such further period as APRA allows; and (c) set out the reasons for making the request."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "316bc1de4fa5c26031684821d4702c42f0f51e32b1a5cf71b8eccff4ceb7b9de" ;
    values:partOf concept:financial-sector-collection-of-data-act-2001-sec-25b ;
    cof:pageNumber "42"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Request for review of decisions must be made in writing and within a specified time period." ;
    dc:description "Reasons for making the request" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
