concept:financial-sector-collection-of-data-act-2001-sec-25d a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "25D Applications to Administrative Review Tribunal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-25d ;
    values:originalText "(1) Applications may be made to the Administrative Review Tribunal for review of decisions of APRA that have been confirmed or varied under section 25C. (3) If a person makes a request under section 25B in respect of a reviewable decision, section 32 of the Administrative Review Tribunal Act 2024 applies as if the making of the request were the" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Applications may be made to the Administrative Review Tribunal for review of decisions of APRA that have been confirmed or varied under section 25C. (3) If a person makes a request under section 25B in respect of a reviewable decision, section 32 of the Administrative Review Tribunal Act 2024 applies as if the making of the request were the"@en ;
